    interiorTest: 'distinct types per room at least 14 (hall), 12 and 12 and over all rooms at least 40 (the list gives 45, assert 45 exactly), the manifest read point of `post-counter` is within 4 m of the `main` door centre, both benches are seat interactables (the number of `notice:` seat registrations equals twice the seat count that `getPropMeta("bench-wood")` declares, and at least 2), the three switches exist and toggle the groups `notice:hall`, `notice:sorting`, `notice:office`, the clerk counter is reachable from the main door by walking (free path width at least 0.8 m through the queue ropes) and the staff door is reachable from the hall',
